<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Theragenics said rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Theragenics said rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Theragenics Corp with a buy rating, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 18-3/4.</p>
